    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Cleaned what could be cleaned. Two stones to a carter with a poor memory and a better one afterward. The third item cannot be cleaned, only contradicted, and contradictions need a second story to lean on.",
